     "explanation": "The cross-functional structure under a single leader with a single metric is the foundational unlock. Without unified ownership, decisions get debated; with it, decisions get shipped. The exact engineer-to-marketer ratio varies by company. Physical separation isn't required (collocation matters more). CEO reporting is common but not the structural lever — single-metric accountability is.",
