      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">Practice: Choose The NSM</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Four criteria to pass</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"140\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"225\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">1. Delivered Value</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"270\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Customer benefit, not company revenue</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"340\" width=\"940\" height=\"140\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"385\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">2. Leading, Not Lagging</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"430\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Predicts revenue rather than reporting it</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"500\" width=\"940\" height=\"140\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"545\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">3. Gaming-Proof</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"590\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Cannot inflate without delivering value</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"660\" width=\"940\" height=\"140\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"705\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">4. Core Use-Case</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"750\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Captures the central job the product does</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"820\" width=\"700\" height=\"60\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"860\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"20\">Write the gaming-test for your NSM</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Pass all four criteria"
