      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">The Experiment Spec</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Eight elements, written first</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"130\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"225\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">1. Hypothesis</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"265\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">\"We believe X causes Y by Z because...\"</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"320\" width=\"940\" height=\"100\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"360\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">2. Variants</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"395\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Control + 1-3 test variants</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"430\" width=\"940\" height=\"100\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"470\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">3. Primary + 4. Secondary metrics</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"505\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">One main number + guardrails</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"540\" width=\"940\" height=\"100\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"580\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">5. Audience</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"615\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Who's eligible? Allocation %?</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"650\" width=\"940\" height=\"100\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"690\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">6. Sample size + duration</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"725\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Power calculator: 80%, 5%, MDE 5-10%</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"760\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"800\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">7. Success + 8. Learning criteria</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"835\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Ship rule + ruled in/out hypothesis</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"870\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Vague spec = uninterpretable result</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Write before you code"
