      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">Booking.com's Platform</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Infrastructure as product</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"100\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"220\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Feature-flag every commit</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"255\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Engineers launch tests without PM approval</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"290\" width=\"940\" height=\"100\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"330\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Slice + auto-rollout</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"365\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">10% to 50% on positive significance</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"400\" width=\"940\" height=\"100\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"440\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Long-term holdout (1%)</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"475\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Clean baseline for 6 months</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"510\" width=\"940\" height=\"100\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"550\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Sequential testing methods</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"585\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Safe peeking via modified t-tests</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"620\" width=\"940\" height=\"100\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"660\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Three-day rule</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"695\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Significance must hold 3 days running</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"730\" width=\"940\" height=\"150\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"775\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">A/A tests + failure sharing</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"815\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Validate platform; learn from losses</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"855\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">At scale: infrastructure IS the product</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Platform investment compounds"
