      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">Eight Failure Modes</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">All have organizational cures</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"460\" height=\"160\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"225\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">HiPPO trap</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"260\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">CEO overrides data</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"295\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Cure: pre-commit rules</text><rect x=\"560\" y=\"180\" width=\"460\" height=\"160\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"580\" y=\"225\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">Vanity metric</text><text x=\"580\" y=\"260\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">Signups over activation</text><text x=\"580\" y=\"295\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Cure: locked NSM</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"360\" width=\"460\" height=\"160\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"405\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">Test theatre</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"440\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">Tests without hypothesis</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"475\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Cure: spec discipline</text><rect x=\"560\" y=\"360\" width=\"460\" height=\"160\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"580\" y=\"405\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">One channel</text><text x=\"580\" y=\"440\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">80%+ concentration</text><text x=\"580\" y=\"475\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Cure: diversify (L5)</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"540\" width=\"460\" height=\"160\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"585\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">Activation neglect</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"620\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">Fuel on leaky funnel</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"655\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Cure: PMF + aha (L2, L4)</text><rect x=\"560\" y=\"540\" width=\"460\" height=\"160\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"580\" y=\"585\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">Premature scaling</text><text x=\"580\" y=\"620\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">20 hires before PMF</text><text x=\"580\" y=\"655\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Cure: stage-gate hiring</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"720\" width=\"460\" height=\"160\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(20,184,166,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"765\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">Burnout</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">30 tests, broken team</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"835\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Cure: sustainable cadence</text><rect x=\"560\" y=\"720\" width=\"460\" height=\"160\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"580\" y=\"765\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"20\">Learning amnesia</text><text x=\"580\" y=\"800\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"17\">Lost test memory</text><text x=\"580\" y=\"835\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"15\">Cure: post-mortem wiki</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Recognize, then cure"
