      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">Atlassian's 90-Day Stand-Up</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Playbook from scratch</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"225\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Days 1-30: Foundation</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"265\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Hire lead, define NSM, instrument events</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"300\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Tier-1 dashboard up, PMF survey at 47%</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"345\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Foundation set in month 1</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"400\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"445\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Days 31-60: Diagnose</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"485\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Cohort: D90 cliff. Aha: 3 collaborators</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"520\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Onboarding audit: 11 steps, no invite</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"565\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Clear problem statement</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"620\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"130\" y=\"665\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">Days 61-90: Ship</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"705\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Onboarding 11 to 4 steps, invite at step 2</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"740\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">5 ICE experiments: 3 won</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"785\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Sprint cadence + wiki locked</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"830\" width=\"700\" height=\"50\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"865\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"20\">D90 retention: 40% -- 53%</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Your future playbook"
