      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">Practice: ICE-Rank 10</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Build your first backlog</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"180\" width=\"940\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"240\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">Step 1: Brainstorm 10</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"300\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Span the AARRR funnel</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"340\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Onboarding, pricing, referral, email, in-app</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"380\" width=\"940\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">Step 2: Score Each</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"500\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Impact × Confidence × Ease</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"540\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Sort descending. Top 3 = next sprint.</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"580\" width=\"940\" height=\"280\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"640\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">Step 3: Critique</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Are top 3 quick wins or moonshots?</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"745\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Are Confidence scores data-justified?</text><text x=\"130\" y=\"790\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Median Impact below 5? Brainstorm more</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"845\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">Then write specs for top 3.</text></svg>",
      "caption": "From idea to ranked plan"
