     "content": "You've covered the full *Hacking Growth* framework: mindset (L1), PMF (L2), team (L3), aha (L4), acquisition (L5), retention (L6), revenue + referral (L7), and the experimentation operating system (L8).\n\nThree commitments to make this week:\n\n1. **Pick one product you can influence** — your company's, a side project, or one you advise. Run the diagnostic from Lesson 2 (PMF score), Lesson 4 (aha hypothesis), and Lesson 6 (cohort chart). One product, three diagnostics, this week.\n\n2. **Write three experiment specs** using the Lesson 8 template. ICE-score them. Ship one within 30 days. The cure for growth-hacking knowledge that fades is shipping.\n\n3. **Join a growth community.** Reforge Pro, GrowthHackers, Lenny's Office Hours, your local SaaStr chapter. Most growth work happens in conversation between practitioners. Find your tribe.\n\nThe operating system in this course is portable. It works at a 5-person startup and at a 5,000-person public company. The mindset is durable across decades. Two-thousand-year-old wisdom: **the master was once the disaster** who shipped one bad experiment, learned, shipped a better one, and never stopped.",
